PN,36501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785944889
OL,3,CSurgeon struck off after "as bad as it
OL,4,Cgets" botched surgery
OL,6,FA doctor who made such a mess of an
OL,7,Foperation that it was described as
OL,8,F"not compatible with life" has been
OL,9,Fstruck off the medical register.
OL,11,FDr Yasser Adly Abdel Rahman, an NHS
OL,12,Flocum surgeon, carried out the
OL,13,Femergency bowel procedure on a young
OL,14,Fman but botched the operation.
OL,16,FIt meant the contents of the patient's
OL,17,Fbowel, leaving his stomach, were re-
OL,18,Fdeposited back into his stomach
OL,19,Fthrough a circular "closed loop", the
OL,20,FMedical Practitioners Tribunal Service
OL,21,F(MPTS) heard.
OL,26,@kD@ZOUlD@EO]pD@AOUpD@ZO]{D@TOU{D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785944889
OL,3,CSurgeon struck off after "as bad as it
OL,4,Cgets" botched surgery
OL,6,FThe patient was left in
OL,7,F"uncontrollable pain" and could have
OL,8,Fdied but for another surgeon
OL,9,Fcorrecting the error in a second
OL,10,Foperation, the misconduct hearing of
OL,11,Fthe MPTS, sitting in Manchester, was
OL,12,Ftold.
OL,14,FDr Rahman at no time considered that
OL,15,Fsomething may have gone wrong
OL,16,Fsurgically, the tribunal heard,
OL,17,Fdespite the patient's parents and
OL,18,Fother medics expressing concerns.
OL,26,@kD@ZOUlD@EO]oD@AOUoD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785944889
OL,3,CSurgeon struck off after "as bad as it
OL,4,Cgets" botched surgery
OL,6,FA former consultant general and
OL,7,Fcolorectal surgeon, acting as the
OL,8,FGeneral Medical Council's expert
OL,9,Fwitness, said the procedure carried
OL,10,Fout by Dr Rahman was "not known to
OL,11,Fman" and his error, "as bad as it
OL,12,Fgets".
OL,14,FDr Rahman, who qualified in 1993 from
OL,15,FAin Shams University in Cairo, Egypt,
OL,16,Fdid not attend the hearing and was not
OL,17,Flegally represented.
OL,26,@kD@ZOUlD@EO]rD@VOUsD@DO]sD@UOUtD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785944889
OL,3,CSurgeon struck off after "as bad as it
OL,4,Cgets" botched surgery
OL,6,FHe claimed he had been made a
OL,7,F"scapegoat" after a "witch hunt"
OL,8,Ffollowing the operation, carried out
OL,9,Fat the Royal Oldham Hospital, where he
OL,10,Fwas working as a locum on August 25,
OL,11,F2020.
OL,13,FThe MPTS imposed an order restricting
OL,14,Fhis work as a doctor in July of the
OL,15,Ffollowing year, but Dr Rahman broke
OL,16,Fthe conditions of the order as he then
OL,17,Fapplied for and secured a job as a
OL,18,Flocum at Affidea Express Care Clinic
OL,19,Fin Ireland in February 2022, the
OL,20,Ftribunal found.
OL,26,@kD@ZOUlD@EO]oD@AOUoD@KO]oD@UOUoD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785944889
OL,3,CSurgeon struck off after "as bad as it
OL,4,Cgets" botched surgery
OL,6,FThis breach of the order imposed on
OL,7,Fhis work was an "aggravating" feature,
OL,8,Fthe tribunal ruled, to already
OL,9,F"significant" errors in surgery and
OL,10,Fpost-op care, the hearing was told.
OL,12,FThe tribunal concluded in a ruling
OL,13,Flast month that Dr Rahman's misconduct
OL,14,Fwas "fundamentally incompatible with
OL,15,Fcontinued registration" and erased him
OL,16,Ffrom the medical register allowing him
OL,17,Fto work as a doctor.
OL,26,@kD@ZOUlD@EO]oD@QOUoD@]O]qD@AOUqD@MO]vD@
OL,26,AEOUwD@WO]
